al Communities Student Services Career Services Counseling Center Disability Services International Services Health Center Student Union Alumni & Giving VSU Alumni Association Get Involved Chapters Board Members Alumni Directory Make a Gift How to Give 1906 Society V-State Club Alumni & Friends Event Calendar In the News Strategic Priorities A culture of excellence Strategic Plan Blazer Ready Blazer Wellness Resources for Current Students Faculty/Staff Alumni Community Visitors Close navigation VSTATE ONLINE Valdosta State University No Fees - Textbooks Included - Classes Start October 14th Our Programs Request Info Apply Today Online college on your terms. With VState Online, you are in control of your education. Flexibility and affordability are key with 8 high-demand fully online programs, easy credit transfer, and non-stop enrollment. It is never too late to get started! Financial Aid Student Support Our Team Faculty Fellows Contact Us Flexible Make it work for you VState Online offers fully online undergraduate degrees. Most courses can be completed in just 8 weeks. Explore our degrees Our Tuition Rate $308 per credit hour Our programs are designed to accelerate your position in the modern workforce with absolutely no hidden fees.   Books are included! Source of data: For each institution, tuition and fee data were obtained from publicly available information published on the institution's official Tuition and Fees webpage. Compare Tuition Rates % reflects the cost greater than VState Online 15% Additional Costs: Books SNHU: $354 per credit hour 29% Additional Costs: One fee per course Phoenix: $398 per credit hour 24% Additional Costs: One fee per quarter Capella: $350 - $415 per credit hour Transfer Credits At VState Online, your experience matters! Use our Prior Learning Assessment (PLA) process to potentially earn credits. We also have an online tool that will help you determine how your credits could transfer. Learn more about transfer credits 5 Start Dates Each Year With multiple start dates each year, you don't have to wait long to start your future. We're ready to help you earn your degree online and on your terms. Step 1 Select the program that's right for you. Explore Our Degrees Step 2 Complete the guided online application. Apply Now Step 3 Apply for Financial Aid Financial Aid 1500 N. Patterson St. Valdosta, Georgia 31698 229.333.5800 About Admissions Academics Campus Life Athletics Alumni Accessibility Title IX Reporting Privacy Statement Ethics Hotlines Safety Information Human Trafficking Notice Report a Website Issue Employment Request Info Printable Campus Map Interactive Campus Map 3D Housing Tour Visit Campus Apply to VSU Make a Gift © 2025 Valdosta State University A Comprehensive University of the University System of Georgia"
